@host = http://localhost:5286
@year = 2024
@apiKey = replace-with-your-Security__ApiKey

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Ingest a season from OpenF1 (~4-5 min, idempotent)
POST {{host}}/api/seasons/{{year}}/ingest
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### List ingested sessions
GET {{host}}/api/seasons/{{year}}/races

### Rebuild the feature table
POST {{host}}/api/features/rebuild
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Train both models
POST {{host}}/api/models/train?year={{year}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Holdout: predictions vs. reality
GET {{host}}/api/seasons/{{year}}/holdout

### Next-race preview
GET {{host}}/api/seasons/{{year}}/next-race

### Standings
GET {{host}}/api/seasons/{{year}}/standings

### Championship forecast
GET {{host}}/api/seasons/{{year}}/championship-forecast

### Title scenarios
GET {{host}}/api/seasons/{{year}}/title-scenarios?topN=5
